  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["CELossLayer",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsNeuralNetworkTools/ref/CELossLayer"], "[", 
   "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "eab40b17-9752-7e41-af3c-da486076ba9a"],
 "\[LineSeparator]represents a net layer that computes the Cross Entropy loss \
by comparing input class probability vectors with the target class vector. \
Identical to CrossEntropyLossLayer[\"Probability\"]."
}], "Usage",
